# SLX CellProof: nominal simulation, metres/radians, no physical robot commands.
CNC DOOR OPEN
WAIT machine_ready 1 TIMEOUT 2
PTP feed_high
LIN feed_approach
LIN feed_pick
GRIP CLOSE
WAIT grip_confirmed 1 TIMEOUT 1.5
LIN feed_approach
PTP home
PTP cnc_high
LIN cnc_outside
LIN cnc_inside
LIN cnc_load
GRIP OPEN
CNC CLAMP
LIN cnc_inside
LIN cnc_outside
PTP cnc_high
CNC DOOR CLOSE
CNC CYCLE 3
CNC DOOR OPEN
LIN cnc_outside
LIN cnc_inside
LIN cnc_load
CNC UNCLAMP
GRIP CLOSE
LIN cnc_inside
LIN cnc_outside
PTP cnc_high
PTP home
LIN metrology_high
LIN metrology_approach
LIN metrology_measure
MEASURE
LIN metrology_approach
LIN home
PTP output_high
LIN output_approach
LIN output_place
GRIP OPEN
LIN output_approach
PTP home
